OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hopes Town of Culture
OL,4,Awill bring change
OL,5,
OL,6,FSandown on the Isle of Wight is in the
OL,7,Ffinal weeks of preparing its bid to
OL,8,Fbecome UK Town of Culture 2028.
OL,10,FThe seaside resort was chosen in July
OL,11,Fas one of 15 finalists from nearly 400
OL,12,Fhopefuls across the country vying for a
OL,13,F#3m prize to stage a showcase of
OL,14,Fcultural events, with two runners-up
OL,15,Feach receiving #250,000.
OL,17,FYears of neglect have seen the once
OL,18,Fthriving tourist hotspot fall into
OL,19,Fdisrepair, with the derelict hotels
OL,20,Falong the town's seafront becoming a
OL,21,Fconstant target of vandalism.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
