OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hopes Town of Culture
OL,4,Awill bring change
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut locals have told me that winning
OL,7,Fthe Town of Culture competition is the
OL,8,Fcatalyst for change that Sandown needs.
